# Scheduled Task Detection — Validation Evidence

## Purpose

This directory stores evidence demonstrating the validation and testing of the Scheduled Task Detection project.

The evidence should make a clear distinction between synthetic test results and validation performed against actual Microsoft Sentinel telemetry.

