## Evidence Handling

- Remove usernames, domain names, hostnames, IP addresses, and other sensitive organizational information before publishing.
- Never upload confidential raw event payloads.
- Do not present synthetic test results as real-world attack detection.
- Keep screenshots consistent with the documented detection version.
- Record the date and environment for each validation activity.

## Current Project Status

Synthetic detection logic has passed six test cases. Positive and negative checks against raw Sentinel telemetry have been reported as successful by the project author.

Structured XML extraction and production analytics-rule deployment remain pending.

This evidence directory should be updated as each validation and deployment milestone is completed.
